sizeof(int) == sizeof(long). But I don't think it's
really important. 

If I were you I'd focused on the quality of development tools
for the "recommended platform".
Assuming size of data types is one of the best ways to 
write code very hard to maintain. Along with some other 
"hard-coded" code it would be not the primary but the only
platform for your application.

